---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import BreadcrumbListSchema from '../components/schema/BreadcrumbListSchema.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site.config';
---

<BaseLayout title={`About | ${site.business.displayName}`} description={`The story behind ${site.business.displayName}.`}>
  <BreadcrumbListSchema
    slot="head"
    crumbs={[
      { name: 'Home', url: Astro.site?.toString() ?? '/' },
      { name: 'About', url: new URL('/about/', Astro.site).toString() },
    ]}
  />
  <section class="px-6 py-16">
    <SectionHeading title="About" />
    <!-- Written by site-copywriter at Stage 5, sourced only from intake. -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-body">
      <p>
        Borinken Landscaping is Hiram, a truck, and a trailer — that's the whole operation.
        There's no dispatcher, no rotating crew. If Hiram gives you an estimate, Hiram is the
        one who shows up and does the work, across {site.serviceAreaLabel}.
      </p>
      <p>
        Mowing, mulch and planting, hedge and tree trimming, palm tree pruning, landscape
        design — those are the main jobs, though not every yard needs all of them, and Hiram
        takes on custom requests beyond that list too. What sets the work apart is the part
        nobody's paying extra for. On one job, that meant getting up on a pole trimmer to shape
        an overgrown topiary into a clean, rounded ball right next to the flagpole — the kind
        of detail most crews walk right past. Hiram doesn't.
      </p>
      <p class="text-text-muted">
        {site.business.tagline} — {site.business.taglineSecondary}. That's not a slogan he
        borrowed. It's how he actually talks about the work.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
